{
  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/rokin_zuid.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Rokin (the city, district 3: Rokin): the south half of Rokin, the main road north to the Dam and Centraal: the basin along its west side with the glass-roofed tour boats at their piers (one heeled over, taking water), the trams' rails, a grand hotel, the Allard Pierson museum in its old bank; dropped luggage, a taxi left with its door open, leaflets everywhere. Modelled after openly licensed photographs; every business name is made up, the landmarks keep theirs. The power is still on; nobody is there. Outdoor (street.py, city.py and landmarks.py build it). Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
